Warning [L0503]: `I` and `l` are visually confusable in this scope
  --> tests/ui_lint/confusable_name.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     I @= 2
    |     ^
 Why: single-character names like `l`, `1`, `I`, `O`, and `0` look identical in many fonts — readers may misread the code
 Fix: rename `I` (or `l`) to a longer, unambiguous name
